## 4. GART VA / PTE layout (target)

| Resource | GART VA | size | PTE idx (VA_LO/4096) |
|---|---|---|---|
| (existing IH/DMA) | 0xF44000_0000 … 0xF4400620_00 | — | 262144 … |
| CP RB0 | 0xF440070000 | 64KB / 16pg | 262256–262271 |
| CP RB1 | 0xF440090000 | 64KB / 16pg | 262288–262303 |
| CP RB2 | 0xF4400B0000 | 64KB / 16pg | 262320–262335 |
| CP ring WB | 0xF4400D0000 | 4KB / 1pg | 262352 |

All within `VM_CONTEXT0` range (START `0xF400000` … END `0xFF3FFFF` pages) and ABOVE the VRAM system
aperture (HIGH `0xF43FFFF`), so they resolve via GART PTEs, not the VRAM aperture. Correct by design.

